      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">זָעַךְ</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: apagar</strong>, somente<br><strong>Niph.</strong>  <em>ser apagado</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">יָמַי נִזְעָ֑כוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 17:1\" href=\"/Job.17.1\">Jb 17:1</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּחִי חֻבָּ֑לָה</span>). Nas demais passagens, sempre <span dir=\"rtl\">דעך</span> (ver respectivo verbete), e assim nas línguas cognatas. Provavelmente erro por <span dir=\"rtl\">נדעכו</span>.",
