      "preview": "זְעָקָה: clamor, grito.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זְעָקָה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino: clamor, grito</strong>, absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 18:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.18.22\">Je 18:22</a> + 5 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">זַעֲקַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:20\" href=\"/Genesis.18.20\">Gn 18:20</a> + 3 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">זַעֲקָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 16:18\" href=\"/Job.16.18\">Jb 16:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">זַעֲקָתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.5\">Is 15:5</a> + 3 vezes;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>clamor</em>, contra, <span dir=\"rtl\">זַעֲקַת סְדֹם וגו׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:20\" href=\"/Genesis.18.20\">Gn 18:20</a> (J).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>clamor de angústia</em>, a respeito de algo <span dir=\"rtl\">זַעֲקַת־שֶׁבֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.5\">Is 15:5</a> (objeto de <span dir=\"rtl\">יְעֹעֵ֑רוּ</span>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּבְכִי</span> na oração anterior); absoluto v. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.8\">8</a> (sujeito de <span dir=\"rtl\">הִקִּיפָה</span>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יְלָלָה</span>); <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 18:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.18.22\">Je 18:22</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(תִּשָּׁמַע ז׳)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.16\">20:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.4\">48:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:46\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.46\">50:46</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 5:6\" href=\"/Nehemiah.5.6\">Ne 5:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:9\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.9\">9:9</a> (todos com <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁמע</span>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:34\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.34\">Je 48:34</a> (unido a <span dir=\"rtl\">נתן קול</span>), <a data-ref=\"Job 16:18\" href=\"/Job.16.18\">Jb 16:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:31\" href=\"/Esther.9.31\">Est 9:31</a> (lamentação), cf. <a data-ref=\"Esther 4:1\" href=\"/Esther.4.1\">4:1</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ גְּדוֹלָה וּמָרָה</span>, acusativo cognato com <span dir=\"rtl\">זעק</span>); especificamente <span dir=\"rtl\">זעקת־דָּ֑ל</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.13\">Pr 21:13</a> <em>clamor dos pobres;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">קול ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 65:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.65.19\">Is 65:19</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קול בכי</span>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:54\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.54\">Je 51:54</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:28\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.28\">Ez 27:28</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>clamor, alarido</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">זעקת מושׁל בַּכְּסִילִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 9:17\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.9.17\">Ec 9:17</a> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">דברי חכמים בְּנַחַת נשׁמעים</span>).",
