      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זְעֵיר</span></big>  <strong>substantivo.</strong>[<strong>masculino.</strong>] <strong>um pouco (</strong>forma diminutiva Ol<sup>§ 180</sup> Lag<sup>BN 85</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  de quantidade, porção (de instrução) <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ שָׁם ז׳ שָׁם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.10\">Is 28:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.13\">13</a> (em ambos ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">צַו</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קַו</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  de tempo, <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּתַּר־לִי ז׳ וַאֲחַוֶּ֑ךָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 36:2\" href=\"/Job.36.2\">Jb 36:2</a>.",
