      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">זָרָה</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo.</strong> espalhar, abanar, joeirar <strong>(</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">ذَرَا</span> <em>fazer voar, espalhar</em> (do vento), <em>joeirar;</em> aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּרָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܕܪܳܐ</span>; etíope ዘረወ: <strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּ֫זֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:20\" href=\"/Exodus.32.20\">Ex 32:20</a>; 2.ª pessoa masculina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּזְרֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 5:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.5.2\">Ez 5:2</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּזְרֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.22\">Is 30:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.16\">41:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֶזְרֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.7\">Je 15:7</a>; imperativo <span dir=\"rtl\">זְרֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:2\" href=\"/Numbers.17.2\">Nu 17:2</a>; infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">לִזְרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.11\">Je 4:11</a>; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">זֹרֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:2\" href=\"/Ruth.3.2\">Ru 3:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.24\">Is 30:24</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>espalhar</em>, o pó a que foi reduzido o bezerro de ouro <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:20\" href=\"/Exodus.32.20\">Ex 32:20</a> (E, objeto não expresso); com acusativo, fogo (estranho) dos incensários <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:2\" href=\"/Numbers.17.2\">Nu 17:2</a> (P); cabelo (ato simbólico) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 5:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.5.2\">Ez 5:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.22\">Is 30:22</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>abanar, joeirar</em>, objeto <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּרֶן הַשְּׂעוֹרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:2\" href=\"/Ruth.3.2\">Ru 3:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.24\">Is 30:24</a> (onde o particípio tem sujeito indefinido), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.16\">41:16</a> metaforicamente, objeto montanhas e colinas, figura da joeira; figurado, abanar, joeirar, na purificação <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.11\">Je 4:11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהָכַ֑ר</span>); no castigo <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.7\">Je 15:7</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(ז׳ בְּמִזְרֶה)</span>.<br><strong>Niph.</strong>  Imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּזָּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.19\">Ez 36:19</a> <em>ser espalhado, dispersado</em>, de Israel; infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּהִזָּרוֹתֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.8\">Ez 6:8</a> <em>quando fordes dispersos</em> (sobre sufixo plural Ew<sup>§ 259 b</sup>, mas Co suprime <span dir=\"rtl\">י</span>).<br><strong>Pi.</strong>  Perfeito com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">וְזֵרָם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.15\">1 K 14:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">זֵרִ֑יתָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 139:3\" href=\"/Psalms.139.3\">ψ 139:3</a>, <strong>com sufixo</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">זֵרִיתָ֫נוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:12\" href=\"/Psalms.44.12\">ψ 44:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְזֵרִיתִ֫י</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 5:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.5.10\">Ez 5:10</a> etc.; infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">זָרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.23\">Ez 20:23</a> etc.;— <strong>1.</strong>  (intensivo de Qal) <em>espalhar, dispersar</em>, especialmente de povos, com acusativo (Israel e Judá) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.15\">1 K 14:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.33\">Lv 26:33</a> (H), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:12\" href=\"/Psalms.44.12\">ψ 44:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.10\">Je 31:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 5:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.5.10\">Ez 5:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 5:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.5.12\">12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.14\">12:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.23\">20:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.15\">22:15</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 2:2\" href=\"/Zechariah.2.2\">Zc 2:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 2:4\" href=\"/Zechariah.2.4\">4</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:27\" href=\"/Psalms.106.27\">ψ 106:27</a>; ossos de Israel <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.5\">Ez 6:5</a>; povo de Hazor <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:32\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.32\">Je 49:32</a>; de Elão <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:36\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.36\">49:36</a>; da Babilônia <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.2\">51:2</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">זָרִים</span> = estrangeiros?); egípcios <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 29:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.29.12\">Ez 29:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.30.26\">30:26</a> + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.30.23\">30:23</a> (Co suprime, por razões internas); em geral os ímpios <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:26\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.26\">Pr 20:26</a>; o mal <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.8\">20:8</a>; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">מְזָרִים</span> = substantivo <em>dispersadores</em>, epíteto dos ventos <a data-ref=\"Job 37:9\" href=\"/Job.37.9\">Jb 37:9</a> (cf. Alcorão 51:1); <span dir=\"rtl\">וְזֵרִיתִי פֶּרֶשׁ על־פניכם</span> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 2:3\" href=\"/Malachi.2.3\">Mal 2:3</a> <em>espalhar</em> esterco sobre os vossos rostos (sinal de vergonha e maldição); figurado <em>dispersar</em> conhecimento (dos lábios) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.7\">Pr 15:7</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>joeirar, peneirar</em> (cf. <strong>Qal 2</strong>) somente figurado <span dir=\"rtl\">אָרְחִי וְרִבְעִי זֵרִ֑יתָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 139:3\" href=\"/Psalms.139.3\">ψ 139:3</a> <em>meu caminho e meu leito tu peneiras</em> (Che; Ba<sup>ZMG 1887, 607</sup> <em>medes, determinas</em>, donde <span dir=\"rtl\">זֶרֶת</span>, ver respectivo verbete)<br><strong>Pu</strong>  <em>ser espalhado,</em> imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יְזֹרֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 18:15\" href=\"/Job.18.15\">Jb 18:15</a>, sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּפְרִית</span>, seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span>; particípio feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">מְזֹרָה</span> (concordando com <span dir=\"rtl\">רָ֑שֶׁת</span> <em>rede</em>) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.17\">Pr 1:17</a>.",
