      "html": "† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">זָרַח</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo: nascer, surgir (</strong>hebraico pós-bíblico <em>idem.</em>, assírio <em>zarâḫu</em> Dl<sup>Pr180</sup>; sabeu <span dir=\"rtl\">דֿרח</span> <em>elevado, majestoso</em> (de rei) e em nome próprio composto DHM<sup>ZMG 1875, 605; 1883, 327</sup> Mordt<sup>ZMG 1876, 37</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.2\">Dt 33:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 112:4\" href=\"/Psalms.112.4\">ψ 112:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">זָרָ֑ח</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.1\">Is 60:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְזָרַח</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.10\">Is 58:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 1:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.1.5\">Ec 1:5</a>; 3.ª pessoa feminina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">זָרְֽחָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:2\" href=\"/Exodus.22.2\">Ex 22:2</a> + 3 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְזָֽרְחָה</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:20\" href=\"/Malachi.3.20\">Mal 3:20</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יִזְרַח</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.4\">2 S 23:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.2\">Is 60:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יִזְרָ֑ח</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 9:7\" href=\"/Job.9.7\">Jb 9:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּזְרַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:32\" href=\"/Genesis.32.32\">Gn 32:32</a>; 3.ª pessoa feminina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּזְרַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:22\" href=\"/Psalms.104.22\">ψ 104:22</a>; infinitivo construto <span dir=\"rtl\">זְרֹחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:33\" href=\"/Judges.9.33\">Ju 9:33</a> <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:8\" href=\"/Joel.4.8\">Jo 4:8</a>; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">זוֹרֵחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 1:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.1.5\">Ec 1:5</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>nascer:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  (do sol) <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:33\" href=\"/Judges.9.33\">Ju 9:33</a> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:17\" href=\"/Nahum.3.17\">Na 3:17</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.4\">2 S 23:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Jonah 4:8\" href=\"/Jonah.4.8\">Jon 4:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 9:7\" href=\"/Job.9.7\">Jb 9:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:22\" href=\"/Psalms.104.22\">ψ 104:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 1:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.1.5\">Ec 1:5</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">על</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:2\" href=\"/Exodus.22.2\">Ex 22:2</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"II Kings 3:22\" href=\"/II_Kings.3.22\">2 K 3:22</a>; seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:32\" href=\"/Genesis.32.32\">Gn 32:32</a> (J). <strong>b.</strong>  figurado, seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁמֶשׁ צְדָקָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:20\" href=\"/Malachi.3.20\">Mal 3:20</a>; de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְזָרַח מִשֵּׂעִיר לָמוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.2\">Dt 33:2</a>; seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">על</span>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.2\">Is 60:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כבודו יראה</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">כבוד י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.1\">Is 60:1</a>; sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹר</span>, figurado (= felicidade, bem-aventurança) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.10\">Is 58:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 112:4\" href=\"/Psalms.112.4\">ψ 112:4</a> (seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span>). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>surgir, aparecer</em>, do aparecimento da lepra <span dir=\"rtl\">(הַצָּרַ֫עַת)</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.19\">2 Ch 26:19</a>.",
